Subject: [PATCH 6/6] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...yncSequence where Self is Sendable, Element is Sendable.swift} | 0
 ...an.swift => Swift.MutableSpan where Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...wift.Span.swift => Swift.Span where Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Standard Library Extensions/{Swift.AsyncSequence.swift => AsyncSequence where Self is Sendable, Element is Sendable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Standard Library Extensions/{Swift.MutableSpan.swift => Swift.MutableSpan where Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Standard Library Extensions/{Swift.Span.swift => Swift.Span where Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.AsyncSequence.swift b/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/AsyncSequence where Self is Sendable, Element is Sendable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.AsyncSequence.swift
rename to Sources/Standard Library Extensions/AsyncSequence where Self is Sendable, Element is Sendable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.MutableSpan.swift b/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.MutableSpan where Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.MutableSpan.swift
rename to Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.MutableSpan where Element is Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.Span.swift b/Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.Span where Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.Span.swift
rename to Sources/Standard Library Extensions/Swift.Span where Element is Copyable.swift
